<p>Your battle cry shatters the will of your foes within a radius of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 7, 8,</acronym> lowering their Defense by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7, 14, 21, 28, 35</acronym> for 7 turns, making them easier to hit.</p><p>All evasion and concealment bonuses are also disabled.</p><p>The chance to hit increases with your Physical Power.</p>